* Koren 12AX7 (normankoren.com): MU 100, EX 1.4, KG1 1060, KP 600, KVB 300, RGI 2k, CCG 2.3p, CGP 2.4p, CCP 0.9p
.SUBCKT 12AX7 P G K
.PARAM MU=100 EX=1.4 KG1=1060 KP=600 KVB=300
B1 7 0 V = V(P,K)/KP*ln(1+exp(KP*(1/MU+V(G,K)/sqrt(KVB+V(P,K)*V(P,K)))))
R7 7 0 1G
B2 P K I = 2*pow(max(V(7),0),EX)/KG1
RCP P K 1G
C1 G K 2.3p
C2 G P 2.4p
C3 P K 0.9p
* grid conduction: diode + RGI
D1 G 8 DGRID
R8 8 K 2k
.MODEL DGRID D(IS=1n RS=1 N=1.5)
.ENDS
